    <shape type="text" topLeftX="480" topLeftY="145" width="420" height="24">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)"><p>最短工作流</p></content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="480" topLeftY="175" width="420" height="240">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(13,19,38,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="190" width="385" height="215">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" fontFamily="Consolas" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5">
        <p>from cinrad.io import StandardData</p>
        <p>from cinrad.io.export import standard_data_to_pyart</p>
        <p>f = StandardData("...Z9731_..._CAP_FMT.bz2")</p>
        <p>radar = standard_data_to_pyart(f)</p>
        <p>disp = pyart.graph.RadarMapDisplay(radar)</p>
        <p>disp.plot_ppi_map('reflectivity', sweep=0,</p>
        <p>    resolution='10m', vmin=-5, vmax=75)</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="430" width="840" height="80">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgba(75,85,99,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">高频坑：</span>字段名是 reflectivity / cross_correlation_ratio（不是 REF/RHO）；数据在 ['data'] 里；sweep 是序号不是角度；dealias 需要 C 编译器。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)">示例：</span>H:\hn\一、Py-ART实习\pyart case 01~04.py（PPI / 地图 / 退模糊 / 估雨）。</p>
      </content>
